.env
# The deploy settings, kept apart from .env because .env becomes the
# container's runtime environment. .env.deploy.example IS tracked.
.env.deploy
# Nobody's real network export belongs in git: a net key plus an app key is full
# control of their lights. The anonymised test fixture is the one exception.
*.connect
!tests/fixtures/*.connect
# A real entities file is a list of what the rooms in someone's home are called,
# so it stays out too. entities.yaml.example, with its made-up network, IS tracked.
entities.yaml
config/
data/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
.DS_Store
